{"id":"int-4f5491f7347366ff667a00e57ffddf09","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-22T21:49:12.247917Z","actor":"josh","issue_id":"recallweave-dm4","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed on foundry/task-contracts. Connection-evidence citations are resolved against the index (exact section match, index-only), fail closed when unresolvable with a content-free diagnostic, and are inventoried in provenance.citations in document order. Passage now requires a citation. Five mutations killed. Cycle-17 Medium (CHANGELOG over-claim on whole-index validation) also fixed and pinned by a docs test. Suite 390 green."}}
